&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has 6+ years of experience as a data scientist performing ads data analysis, ML model building and optimization, financial analysis, market research, and executive reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in AdTech / Advertising (search, display, branding, retargeting, social, streaming video…), Digital Marketing, Ad Agency, or related domains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python or R&amp;nbsp;for statistical analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hive, Presto, Airflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML modeling design, deployment, and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong statistics&amp;nbsp;background&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in working on backend and ML systems for large-scale user-facing products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data visualization (e.g.,&amp;nbsp;Tableau, Qlik, Looker, Power BI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent quantitative analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously for multiple stakeholders in a fast-paced organization&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
