forerunnerventures-stress-free:greenhous.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Team at Stress-Free Auto Care: Where Your Skills and Passion Drive Success!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stress Free Auto Care is redefining the auto repair experience by delivering exceptional service with honesty, transparency, and convenience. Our mission is simple: make auto care a stress-free, trustworthy experience for everyone. Join us on this exciting journey and play a pivotal role in reshaping the automotive service industry!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stress-Free Auto Care is seeking an Operations Program Manager to support the execution of strategic initiatives across our rapidly growing organization. This role serves as a force multiplier for executive leadership, ensuring critical projects are delivered on time, cross-functional teams remain aligned, and operational priorities are executed consistently across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Operations Program Manager will work directly with executive leadership and partner closely with Operations, Customer Experience, Finance, Human Resources, Recruiting, Technology, Marketing, and Corporate Development. This individual will be responsible for driving accountability, managing complex projects, coordinating communication across departments, and ensuring organizational priorities are translated into measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an exceptionally organized, analytical, and execution-oriented leader who thrives in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Initiative Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate company-wide strategic initiatives from planning through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop project plans, timelines, milestones, ownership assignments, and reporting structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure critical initiatives remain on schedule and obstacles are identified and resolved quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility into all major organizational priorities and proactively escalate risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive leadership in driving organizational priorities and special projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare materials, reporting, presentations, and analyses for leadership meetings, board meetings, and strategic planning sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate follow-up and accountability across leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage action item tracking and ensure commitments are completed on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly Business Review (WBR) Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and distribute Weekly Business Review reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate operational performance metrics across stores, districts, and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify performance trends, opportunities, and risks requiring leadership attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate follow-up actions resulting from WBR discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Performance &amp;amp; Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key operational metrics across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify underperformance and partner with leaders to develop corrective action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress against goals and ensure follow-through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in developing scalable systems and processes as the company grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Development &amp;amp; Growth Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support acquisition, diligence, integration, and store launch activities as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional efforts related to new store openings, conversions, and operational transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project milestones and ensure readiness across all involved departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document, improve, and standardize operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies and develop scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems that improve communication, accountability, and execution across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of operational leadership, project management, consulting, business operations, or related experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously with competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency with spreadsheets, reporting, and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in multi-unit operations, retail, automotive, hospitality, franchising, or other distributed service businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting executive leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial analysis, forecasting, or business planning experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A, integration, or corporate development exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building operational reporting and KPI dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Characteristics of Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is relentlessly organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates clarity in ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds people accountable while maintaining strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follows through on commitments and expects the same from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipates problems before they occur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly and concisely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-moving, entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focuses on outcomes rather than activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates with urgency and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$110,000 – $150,000 annually&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Performance Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Target bonus opportunity of 20% of base salary, based on company performance, strategic initiative completion, and individual performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Incentive Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eligible for project-based incentive programs, including acquisition, integration, store launch, and other strategic growth initiatives as assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development Opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Mentorship and Leadership Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Elevate Your Career?&lt;/strong&gt; If you’re interested in joining a supportive team that values your skills and dedication, we’d love to hear from you! &lt;strong&gt;Apply today&lt;/strong&gt; to help us redefine automotive care.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

foresitecapital-syndax-pharmaceuticals:g.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Syndax Pharmaceuticals is looking for a &lt;u&gt;Senior Manager, Boomi Developer&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Syndax, we are determined to realize a future in which people with cancer live longer and better than ever before. Syndax Pharmaceuticals is a commercial stage biopharmaceutical company developing an innovative pipeline of cancer therapies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note, the ideal candidate for this role will be located in the Northeast.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Syndax Pharmaceuticals is&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a highly motivated&amp;nbsp;Senior Manager, Boomi&amp;nbsp;Developer&amp;nbsp;to design, build, and support integrations across our enterprise application ecosystem. This role is primarily focused on Boomi&amp;nbsp;AtomSphere&amp;nbsp;development, including integration workflows and Master Data Hub (MDH), while also supporting and enhancing critical employee lifecycle integrations (onboarding and offboarding).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a proactive, adaptable self-starter who thrives in a fast-paced, small biotech environment. This individual will take ownership across multiple areas,&amp;nbsp;quickly&amp;nbsp;learn new systems, and contribute beyond their core&amp;nbsp;expertise. Experience with the Boomi platform and enterprise applications is essential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to help scale integration capabilities in a growing commercial-stage biotechnology organization, enabling efficient and reliable data flow across enterprise systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;integrations using Boomi&amp;nbsp;AtomSphere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and support data synchronization and governance processes within Boomi Master Data Hub (MDH)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full integration lifecycle, including:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requirements gathering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution design and development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing and deployment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data accuracy and consistency across employee lifecycle events (hire, transfer, termination)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve integration issues while&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;system reliability and data integrity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize&amp;nbsp;integrations for performance, scalability, and maintainability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;technical documentation, including integration mappings and process flows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business and technical stakeholders&amp;nbsp;across G&amp;amp;A, Clinical and Commercial teams&amp;nbsp;to translate requirements into scalable solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Compliance and Security teams to ensure adherence to data privacy, security, and audit requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for other enterprise applications and platforms,&amp;nbsp;as needed&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;NetSuite, Concur)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of&amp;nbsp;Syndax’s&amp;nbsp;integration architecture and standards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage environments and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;best practices for testing and promotion to production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Experience/Education and Personal Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science&amp;nbsp;or a related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of hands-on experience developing integrations using Boomi&amp;nbsp;AtomSphere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boomi Data Integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boomi Data Hub&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boomi Flow&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boomi Molecule Infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data mapping, transformation, and error handling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise applications (e.g., HRIS, ERP, ATS, Contract Management); NetSuite experience preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing external vendors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of APIs and web services (REST/SOAP)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SQL for data analysis and validation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ITSM platforms (e.g.,&amp;nbsp;Freshservice, ServiceNow)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience supporting:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee lifecycle integrations (ATS, HRIS, Payroll, IAM/SSO)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Procure-to-Pay integrations (ERP, Procurement systems)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audits (e.g.&amp;nbsp;SOX)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in life sciences, biotech, or other regulated environments&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Boomi AI capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Style &amp;amp; Expectations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced biotech environment requiring flexibility and adaptability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a willingness to take on diverse responsibilities across integrations and broader IT initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a self-starter who takes ownership and drives work forward independently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly learn new systems, tools, and business processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively manage multiple priorities while&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;high quality and accountability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work both independently and collaboratively across teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail with a focus on data quality and reliability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, resourceful, and proactive in evolving environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Syndax’s corporate office is in New York, NY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Syndax offers a total compensation and rewards package that is among the most competitive in the industry. Base pay is just one element of our package and is determined within a range based on several factors including market data, experience, qualifications, demonstrated skills, relevant education or training, travel requirements and internal equity. Our overall package also includes an equity offering, annual target bonuses, and an outstanding benefits program. The anticipated annualized salary range for this role is $160,000-$175,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Syndax:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Syndax Pharmaceuticals is a commercial-stage biopharmaceutical company advancing innovative cancer therapies. Highlights of the Company’s pipeline include a menin inhibitor for R/R acute leukemia and a monoclonal antibody that blocks the CSF-1 receptor for chronic graft-versus-host disease. Fueled by our commitment to reimagining cancer care, Syndax is working to unlock the full potential of its pipeline and is conducting several clinical trials across the continuum of treatment. For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globenewswire.com%2FTracker%3Fdata%3DrCAVnMToulbfZv6WH-CwoAOkYpm_Zgk-73ncBiDnf3nIX6R3CClytFbSaCr38-uyz2V0Pk2LozJ-QwSHS6X0TSUH8ksfUpHQPeejdWP_C3UjPSPN4YE9QerowK_ttD5hTVuH8uxQf-KWvDu3st-pcTRGKMXkcww7XNvGOSAxWWaYf_a20AAx9mxGY2DmomHwds4yYDrO-O7Rqb06KaQXIA%3D%3D&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cdconrad%40syndax.com%7C62774ab8166749c0867908dd8cbc307e%7C2fe7898cf9fb418abd81f98ad3cc1894%7C0%7C0%7C638821462075993064%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=FjZavjSrcbWTQEJ4Yx2dMavm1j9K7BMpigGW%2BzeBFmA%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.syndax.com/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or follow the Company on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globenewswire.com%2FTracker%3Fdata%3Dwx7WvIgknTbUrdGoBqJDyfmnZv7YjpVw69FBz4FPIpAMSR6p-6G-1eEU1NN_PYKazoY9Fnu0i7tbtlt6kOsyUg%3D%3D&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cdconrad%40syndax.com%7C62774ab8166749c0867908dd8cbc307e%7C2fe7898cf9fb418abd81f98ad3cc1894%7C0%7C0%7C638821462076005193%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=VPfzxHWAdn51W%2FJvK0R9ElN%2BSta428MFv8%2BffmvPXhg%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globenewswire.com%2FTracker%3Fdata%3DutvMIwxxtq4HsdhXEGUK-9naWAlyxWDCUVWYC1-zQ7-ItUe3nCkvSO7W03MncrtTIB7B3XLR46VSIPMFMm-7GX7qEUXdHT_eLp5paIn9pm95jkReA1YyJUpBBv81rWV-kVoUvHDOXdizDQ9AMsN2mvY404a1ud9AxuKCGhyI1NNyy6VaAhUaJ-PuUcADGMJQCYBQ4RES4q0WgT9UuJZR6Egj0ets0CXh885IchTskB4%3D&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cdconrad%40syndax.com%7C62774ab8166749c0867908dd8cbc307e%7C2fe7898cf9fb418abd81f98ad3cc1894%7C0%7C0%7C638821462076017518%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=L%2FdGgGGvBw0KMvBqm25ukL5ubX38Yz8cifjS0A%2F1fEA%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Syndax Pharmaceuticals is an equal opportunity employer and will not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of age, color, disability, gender, national origin, race, religion, sexual orientation, veteran status, or any classification protected by federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

foundry-appdirect:greenhouse:8547566002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppDirect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Become a digital, global citizen and enable the new generation of digital entrepreneurs around the world. AppDirect offers a subscription commerce platform to sell any product, through any channel, on any device - as a service. We power millions of subscriptions worldwide for organizations. We do this by our values-driven culture - one that enables you to Be Seen, Be Yourself, and Do Your Best Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, high-visibility role for a senior PR professional who wants to own the media narrative for a growing company. As Media Relations Director, you&#39;ll shape and execute our earned media strategy, working directly with executives to land stories in top-tier business and technology outlets. We&#39;re looking for someone with deep journalist relationships, sharp instincts, and the ability to turn company moments into compelling coverage. If you want a seat at the table—not a seat at an agency—this is it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Relations Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full media relations function end-to-end—strategy through execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and drive a proactive, calendar-driven PR program aligned with product launches, company milestones, and brand priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and pursue compelling story angles that resonate with journalists and align with business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch relentlessly—leverage your relationships to secure placements in tier-1 outlets (WSJ, Forbes, TechCrunch, Bloomberg, NYT, Fast Company, etc.) and top industry trades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inbound media inquiries with speed and sound judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and produce all media materials: press releases, pitches, media alerts, bylines, op-eds, briefing docs, talking points, and Q&amp;amp;As&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief and prep executives for interviews; provide real-time support during media engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor news cycles and identify rapid-response opportunities to insert our POV into relevant conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Relations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and grow a robust network of journalist relationships across business, tech, and trade media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the kind of PR pro who can pick up the phone and get a reporter&#39;s attention—not just send cold emails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track journalist beats, interests, and coverage patterns to personalize outreach and increase hit rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust with reporters through transparency, reliability, and delivering quality stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyst Relations Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our analyst relations contractor to coordinate messaging and briefings with firms like Gartner, Forrester, and IDC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align media narratives with analyst positioning and ensure consistency across external audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analyst report cycles and inquiries as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Executive Visibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and pitch thought leadership content (bylines, op-eds, podcast appearances, speaking opps) to elevate executive profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position our leaders as credible voices on industry trends, innovation, and company mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ghostwrite or heavily support executive content for external publication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on media coverage quality, volume, sentiment, and share of voice vs. competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular updates to leadership on PR program performance and media landscape insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use media monitoring tools to stay ahead of relevant news and competitive activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Marketing, Content, Demand Gen, and Executive Comms to align messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Legal and HR on sensitive communications when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with events and campaigns teams to maximize PR around key moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Integration &amp;amp; Media Evolution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and platforms to augment daily workflows, media research, content creation, and real-time monitoring, enhancing overall operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively analyze the evolving media landscape through the ever evolving AI lens, understanding its impact on reporting, discovery, and audience engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement forward-thinking PR strategies that capitalize on AI-driven changes, ensuring our media relations efforts remain innovative and effective in achieving organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in PR/media relations, ideally a mix of agency and in-house experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have real, working relationships with reporters at major business and tech outlets (e.g., TechCrunch, WSJ, Forbes, relevant industry trades). You don&#39;t just pitch—you get replies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can do it all: write tight copy, craft compelling pitches, manage multiple priorities, and deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in B2B tech, SaaS, or enterprise software strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native news instincts. You know what makes a story, how to frame it, and when to strike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working directly with C-suite; able to prep, coach, and support execs in media moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self starter: You thrive with autonomy and high accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing and editing abilities—press releases, pitches, bylines, talking points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with analyst relations a plus, but not required—you&#39;ll learn our program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with media databases (Cision, Muck Rack, etc.), monitoring tools, and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AppDirect, we believe that innovation thrives in an environment that houses diversity of excellence, experience and thought. We respect each AppDirector as their own fingerprint; unique with no one alike. We foster an environment of inclusion without regard to race, religion, age, sexual orientation, or gender identity enabling AppDirectors to embrace their uniqueness to do their best work. As such, we strongly encourage applications from Indigenous peoples, racialized people, people with disabilities, people from gender and sexually diverse communities, and/or people with intersectional identities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AppDirect we take privacy very seriously. For more information about our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;use and handling of personal data from job applicants, please read our Candidate Privacy Policy. For more information of our general privacy practices, please see AppDirect Privacy Notice:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appdirect.com/about/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appdirect.com/about/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;https://www.appdirect.com/about/privacy-notice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AppDirect, AI tools may assist our recruitment team with administrative automations — always under human oversight. AI tools do not make hiring decisions or solely automated decisions about your candidacy – all decisions are made by our people. By submitting your application, you acknowledge that your information may be processed in this way. You may request access or deletion at any time by contacting privacy@appdirect.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The salary band listed above reflects the expected annual base salary or OTE (on-target earnings) for this role at AppDirect and may be subject to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Base salary or OTE is just one component of AppDirect’s total compensation package. In addition to base pay, regular employees may be eligible for performance-based bonuses and a full range of benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;California Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

freestyle-crexi:greenhouse:4677696005.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Crexi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Crexi is reimagining commercial real estate with an AI-powered platform built to deliver smarter, more efficient solutions at every stage of the deal lifecycle. From real-time data and market insights generated by Crexi Intelligence, to targeted property marketing and seamless deal management through Crexi PRO, and a transparent, time-bound bidding experience with Crexi Auction— Crexi enables users to evaluate opportunities, maximize exposure, and close with speed and confidence. To date, Crexi has facilitated over $1 trillion in transactions, 8.6 billion square feet leased, and supports a growing community of more than 2 million monthly active users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Crexi’s mission is to catalyze the next generation of commercial real estate through three core pillars:&amp;nbsp;Access, Innovation, and Connection. Crexi’s platform democratizes CRE by providing unprecedented access to market insights and opportunities, accelerates CRE dealmaking with purpose-built technology that enhances speed and transparency; and empowers CRE professionals with a centralized platform designed for real-time collaboration and success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Recruiter plays a key role in shaping and strengthening Crexi’s culture and success by identifying candidates who align with the company’s mission. This position contributes to the Crexi’s revenue growth goals and collaborates closely with Intelligence and Pro hiring managers to find the best talent for revenue-focused roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works closely with Talent Acquisition, People teams, and hiring managers to attract, source, and hire stellar candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meets with and works closely with the hiring managers to get insight on their recruiting needs and obtain feedback on candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides an organized, comprehensive, and overall incredible candidate interviewing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses LinkedIn and other tools to proactively engage passive and active candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sources, screens, and coordinates interviews between the candidate and hiring team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helps track recruiting funnel metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completes and submits candidate interviews via Greenhouse and reminds hiring team to complete notes as well in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attends recruiting events to meet and engage candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performs other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 &amp;nbsp;years of experience successfully recruiting, agency experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using recruiting tools such as LinkedIn Recruiter and any modern ATS (Greenhouse, Lever, TalentHub, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who independently owns their own success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills and an ability to provide clear and concise insights to the hiring team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsive, action-oriented, and innovative problem solver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong and efficient teamwork and cross-department collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management, organizational and prioritization skills and an ability to demonstrate and handle multiple tasks accurately and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attitude that takes a problem-solving approach to tasks or projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fantastic interpersonal and soft skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of discretion and ability to maintain absolute confidentiality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Crexi?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Rapidly growing startup with a dynamic work environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Flexible team structure with the ability to progress in career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Health, Dental, and Vision insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Collaborative culture and numerous team activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The anticipated base salary range for candidates who will work in our Playa Vista, California location is $75,000 to $100,000. The final salary offered to a successful candidate will depend on several factors, which may include, but are not limited to, the type and length of experience applicable to the role and within the industry, education, geographic location, etc. Commercial Real Estate Exchange, Inc (“Crexi”) is a multi-state employer, and this salary range may not reflect positions that work in other states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-preview__description &quot; data-test-description=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crexi is an EEO Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability or protected veteran status. Crexi will also consider for employment qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with EEOC guidelines and applicable local law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-cookunity:greenhouse:7634455003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About CookUnity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Food has lost its soul to modern convenience. And with it, it has lost the power to nourish, inspire, and connect us. So in 2018, CookUnity was founded as the first-of-its-kind platform that connects the world with the source of truly great food: chefs. Today, CookUnity delivers 50 million meals a year from the industry’s best chefs to homes all over the country. Fresh. Ready-to-eat. And crafted with the passion that nourishes body and soul.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Unwilling to stop there, CookUnity is expanding beyond delivery to become an ever-innovating marketplace focused on our singular mission: &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;empower Chefs to nourish the world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;If that mission has you hungry in more ways than one, you’ve found the right job posting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;99&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;103&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;As a Quality Control (QC) Associate at CookUnity, you play a key role in ensuring the quality, accuracy, and presentation of meals throughout the production process. You’ll support the QC team by conducting basic inspections, applying labels, and maintaining food safety standards to ensure every meal meets our quality expectations before it reaches our eaters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;741&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on, detail-oriented role within a fast-paced production environment. You will assist with receiving meals, performing visual and temperature checks, supporting labeling and sealing tasks, and maintaining an organized and compliant QC workspace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;748&quot; data-end=&quot;763&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;752&quot; data-end=&quot;763&quot;&gt;You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;765&quot; data-end=&quot;1184&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;765&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;
