&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Habilitation is currently seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Habilitation Technician &lt;/strong&gt;to work as a Caregiver for individuals with autism, intellectual, or developmental &lt;span class=&quot;WOR0&quot;&gt;disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Compassionate&lt;/span&gt; caregivers embody both empathy and respect in every interaction, striving to uplift and empower the people they support.&amp;nbsp; Our caregivers provide 1:1 support in the home and in the community.&lt;/p&gt;
