&lt;p&gt;Spend time on the client’s favorite hobbies and activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist with everyday tasks, such as meal preparation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
